<section class="calculator-section active" aria-labelledby="practicalTitle">
    <h2 id="practicalTitle">기존 전세금과 갱신 제안액 입력</h2>
    <form id="practicalForm" data-practical-tool="jeonse">
        <div class="tax-form-card form-grid">
            <div class="form-group"><label for="practical-previous">현재 계약의 전세보증금 (원)</label><input id="practical-previous" name="previous" type="text" class="money-input" inputmode="numeric" value="300,000,000" required></div>
            <div class="form-group"><label for="practical-proposed">새로 제안받은 전세보증금 (원)</label><input id="practical-proposed" name="proposed" type="text" class="money-input" inputmode="numeric" value="318,000,000" required></div>
            <div class="form-group"><label for="practical-capRate">비교할 인상 상한 (%)</label><input id="practical-capRate" name="capRate" aria-describedby="practical-capRate-help" type="number" value="5" min="0" max="5" step="any" required><small id="practical-capRate-help">기본 5%입니다. 적용되는 지역 상한이 더 낮으면 그 비율로 바꾸세요.</small></div>
        </div>
        <p id="practicalError" class="notice-text" role="alert" tabindex="-1" hidden></p>
